      <activity id="6545b2fb-5dac-50d1-a52b-eb6647c0abd8" activityNameId="853169d6-fc13-566e-8548-813077d731f6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Refinery gas, burned in furnace</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refinery gas, burned in furnace
Description of the direct emissions due to the combustion of refinery gas in refinery furnaces and generators not including the infrastructure of the furnace.;
UUID: 5c81d3c9-cad0-3a6d-9b29-82c7b0a6aba8
Consumption of refinery gas and combustion emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology in use.
Time period: Swiss data for regulated emissions like CO2, NOx, SOx etc. have been provided by the refineries. They have been compared and discussed with older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Environmental reports, public statistics and literature data. 
Extrapolations: Methane, CO, Hg and particulates are estimated with European figures.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c81d3c9-cad0-3a6d-9b29-82c7b0a6aba8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
